          "title": "React Router Routes and Nested Outlets",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Routes as Data",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`createBrowserRouter([{ path, element, children }])` declares the ==route tree==",
                "Hand it to `<RouterProvider router={router} />`",
                "Child `path` is ==relative== to the parent",
                "Child renders inside the parent's layout"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "jsx",
              "lines": [
                "const router = createBrowserRouter([{",
                "  path: \"/\", element: <Layout />,",
                "  children: [",
                "    { index: true, element: <Home /> },",
                "    { path: \"users/:id\", element: <User /> },",
                "    { path: \"*\", element: <NotFound /> },",
                "  ]}]);"
              ],
              "note": "render with <RouterProvider router={router} />"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Outlet, Index, Layout",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Parent renders `<Outlet />` where the matched child appears",
                "{red:No Outlet} means children never show",
                "`{ index: true }` renders at the parent's ==exact path==",
                "Layout route with ==no path== adds shared UI only"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Matching Rank",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Static",
                    "sub": "/users/new",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Dynamic",
                    "sub": "/users/:id",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Splat",
                    "sub": "*",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Ranks by ==specificity==, not by order in the array",
                "`path: '*'` is the catch-all ==404== route"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Layout not showing?",
              "text": "Check the parent for `<Outlet />`. Without it, ==children never render==."
